# THE BAY'S PARTS LOCKER (docs/GEAR.md §7, G6): a maintenance bay is nobody's
# home (InteriorKind.seats), so what it holds is in a strongbox -- the locker at
# the niche's closed end, shut on what the plan issues its bodies. Opened once.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/bay_locker.tour --seed=4 --hour=15 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01 is at the locker, by the lantern. 02 is after use: what it gave up.
coast calm
near door:maintenance_bay
await door 5
press use 0.1
await inside:maintenance_bay 5
tap lamp
wait 0.6
near strongbox
wait 0.6
shot 01-the-parts-locker-in-the-niche with inside:maintenance_bay,box_near,lamp
press use 0.1
await box_opened 3
wait 0.6
shot 02-what-the-plan-issued with inside:maintenance_bay,lamp
